WEBVTT

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:33.416
we must ask ourselves,

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.080
"Where does it hurt

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.080
and what is the source of the hurt?"

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:48.616
I propose that we must look

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:52.000
deeply into the culture of whiteness.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:57.736
That is a river that drowns out
all of our identities

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:03.280
and drowns us in false uniformity
to protect the status quo.